{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-lossless-context#card-zh","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-lossless-context","commit":"288c65f7c97cdad55733691023aa8bdbd136b6e4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Lossless Context（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为长会话提供分层上下文压缩和原文召回。它接入 DSH 原生压缩后端，并注册当前会话只读检索工具。可按层生成摘要、保留摘要来源、按词搜索并展开原始事件，也能在空闲时预备摘要。适合需管理长对话并查回历史细节的 DSH 用户。需兼容的 DSH 会话、压缩和模型服务，无需单独配置 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-50","agent.js:52-69","recall.js:50-75"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-lossless-context#card-en","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-lossless-context","commit":"288c65f7c97cdad55733691023aa8bdbd136b6e4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Lossless Context adds layered compaction and retrieval to DSH. Its native backend and session tool search older events, inspect summary sources, and expand original text. Idle agents can prepare reusable summaries. Requires compatible DSH session, compaction, and model services.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-50","agent.js:52-69","recall.js:50-75"]}
